linkCode.body:
Hello {name},

Your code to open your space on Symbola: {code}

It is valid for {minutes} minutes and can be used only once. If you did not ask for it, ignore this message: nobody can open your space without your link.

renewalRequest.body:
Hello,

{name} is asking for a new personal link: theirs has expired. You can renew it from the event page:

{url}

quoteSigned.body:
Hello,

Quote {number} has been signed by all signers. The event is now confirmed. The signed document and its audit certificate are available on the quote:

{url}

organizationClosureNotice.body:
Hello,

The closed workspace “{organization}” will be deleted on {until}, with all its data and documents. Remember to export your data by then, or reopen the workspace:

{url}

organizationClosed.body:
Hello,

The workspace “{organization}” is closed. It will be deleted on {until}, with all its data and documents. Until then, you can export your data or reopen the workspace:

{url}

invitation.body:
Hello,

You have been invited to join "{organization}" on Symbola. This link is valid for 7 days:

{url}

actionCode.body:
Hello {name},

Your code to accept and sign your proposal on Symbola: {code}

It is valid for {minutes} minutes and can be used only once. If you did not ask for it, ignore this message and let your contact know.

subscriptionTrialReminder.body:
Hello,

The trial of “{organization}” ends on {date}. To carry on without interruption, choose a plan in “My subscription”. Without a plan, your space will become read-only: nothing will be deleted and export will remain available.

{url}

subscriptionTrialEnded.body:
Hello,

The trial of “{organization}” ended on {date}. Your space is now read-only: your data is kept, you can view and export everything. Choose a plan to resume.

{url}

subscriptionCancelled.body:
Hello,

The cancellation of the subscription of “{organization}” is recorded. You keep access until {date}. The space will then be closed: export remains available for 30 days, then everything is deleted. You can withdraw the cancellation until that date.

{url}

storageQuotaAlert.body:
Hello,

The storage space of “{organization}” is {percent}% used. Nothing is blocked. To keep some room, delete unneeded files or add storage in “My subscription”.

{url}

storageQuotaFull.body:
Hello,

The storage space of “{organization}” is full. New uploads will be refused from {date}, unless you free some space or add storage by then. Viewing and exporting your data always remain possible.

{url}
